[I] An "all-platform" eMule client

[T] The "all-platform eMule", it is a eMule-like client for ed2k
[T] network, supporting Linux, *BSD platforms, Solaris, *MacOSX
[T] and *Win32 (*soon). It was forked from xMule project back in
[T] september 2003 (not related to it anymore, except little bits
[T] of old code), to drive it to a brand new direction and quality.
[T] Uses wxWidgets (formely known as wxWindows) for multiplatform
[T] support.

[U] https://www.amule.org/

[A] Kry <kry@amule.org>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 3.2.0
[P] X -----5---9 131.700

[D] d87736e1400eb353ee32bd43245461bd187866d5712d7f8ebe08a8f4 aMule-3.2.0-src.tar.gz https://github.com/amule-org/amule/releases/download/3.2.0/

[ "$SDECFG_PKG_AMULE_DAEMON" != 0 ] && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_DAEMON=ON
[ "$SDECFG_PKG_AMULE_CMD" != 0 ] && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_AMULECMD=ON
[ "$SDECFG_PKG_AMULE_WEBSERVER" != 0 ] && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_WEBSERVER=ON
[ "$SDECFG_PKG_AMULE_REMOTEGUI" != 0 ] && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_REMOTEGUI=ON
[ "$SDECFG_PKG_AMULE_CAS" != 0 ] && var_append cmakeopt ' ' '-DBUILD_CAS=ON -DBUILD_WXCAS=ON'
[ "$SDECFG_PKG_AMULE_ALC" != 0 ] && var_append cmakeopt ' ' '-DBUILD_ALC=ON -DBUILD_ALCC=ON'
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=OFF
pkginstalled libupnp || var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DENABLE_UPNP=OFF

var_append INSTALL_WRAPPER_FILTER '|' 'sed -e s,ed2k,ed2k_amule,'
